+$ printf 'AUDIT_MODE=%s\n' "$AUDIT_MODE"
+AUDIT_MODE=CLASSIFICATION_AND_PROOF
+
+$ lean --version
+error: failed to locate application
+
+$ cat /proc/self/status | rg '^(Pid|NSpid|PPid|Tgid):'
+Tgid:	1259
+Pid:	1259
+PPid:	1258
+NSpid:	1259	3
+
+The sandbox returned inner PID 3 from getpid(), but /proc exposed outer PID
+1259. Lean 4.22 resolves its prefix with /proc/<getpid>/exe, so the mismatch
+caused the pre-project failure. The narrowly scoped shim in
+00-lean-proc-pid-shim.c returns the outer Pid field only.
+
+$ gcc -shared -fPIC -O2 /tmp/audit-work/lean-proc-pid-shim.c -o /tmp/audit-work/lean-proc-pid-shim.so
+$ LD_PRELOAD=/tmp/audit-work/lean-proc-pid-shim.so lean --version
