+
+$ kompile --version
+K version:    v7.1.293
+Build date:   Fri Oct 03 13:32:35 CDT 2025
+
+$ kprove --version
+K version:    v7.1.293
+Build date:   Fri Oct 03 13:32:35 CDT 2025
